abstract: >-
  NeuroDataHub is the open-access neuroimaging datasets
  platform designed to help researchers, clinicians, and
  students explore, compare, and analyze brain imaging data
  with ease. This comprehensive brain imaging research hub
  brings together an extensive collection of 50+ carefully
  curated public neuroimaging datasets, containing over
  50,000 brain scans from multiple modalities including MRI,
  fMRI, DWI, EEG, and PET.
